# 0e_temple_hive_hall (layers 3 4), cable worker u048d (a.k.a. u0636): morph ball under it, WaitOnCable idle timer, MBallMoved,
# GrabMBall (Attach), then GrabSac/Rise/DropAndExplode bodies via statecall (the shipped FSM2 has no node for GrabMBall).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/splinter.py <out> 3bfa3eff,0e_temple_hive_hall --con <this> --fast --frames 2200
@f300 god 1; give missile 50; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; fastmorph 1
@f302 layer 3; layer 4
@f305 send u0604 Activate; send u0602 Activate; send u048d Activate; send u048a Activate; send u0487 Activate
@f310 tp 87 -349 -89
@f340 press x 30
@f400 fsm u048d WaitOnCable
@f500 trigcall u048d MBallMoved
@f520 statecall u048d WaitOnCable 1
@f700 tp 88 -349 -89
@f710 statecall u048d WaitOnCable 1; trigcall u048d MBallMoved
@f800 statecall u048d GrabMBall 0
@f805 obj u048d
@f806 statecall u048d GrabMBall 1; statecall u048d GrabMBall 2
@f810 trigcall u048d MBallMoved; trigcall u048d MorphballWaiting
@f900 statecall u048d GrabSac 0; statecall u048d GrabSac 2
@f910 statecall u048d Rise 0; statecall u048d Rise 1; statecall u048d Rise 2
@f1000 press x 30
@f1100 statecall u048d WaitOnCable 0; trigcall u048d MBallMoved
@f1200 statecall u048d DropAndExplode 0; statecall u048d DropAndExplode 1
